# Step 27: the RPC server. The rules of `cortex-rpc` and of `cortex serve`,
# broken one at a time, with the tests that must fail. Written with the
# code (docs/steps/27/answered.md).

[break] a-request-before-initialize-is-run
rule: Nothing but `initialize` is taken before it: any other request is refused `not_initialized`.
